<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Dear&nbsp;</span>{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">I hope this email finds you well!</span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">Did you know that 300+ health systems own a health plan, many of which consider themselves to be Payviders, and that&nbsp;<span style="color:black">54% of these Payvider models are based on risk or capitation payments</span>? This innovative approach to healthcare delivery aligns the interests of payers and providers, ultimately enhancing care coordination, improving outcomes, and driving engagement.</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">As we navigate the evolving landscape of healthcare together, I want to share a </span><a href="https://www.teladochealth.com/organizations/resources/virtual-care-solutions-for-payviders"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">new executive brief</span></a> <span style="font-size:11.0pt">about how Teladoc Health is positioned to support the unique needs of Payviders, and their populations. You'll read about relevant&nbsp;topics such as:&nbsp;</span><br />
&nbsp;
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Closing care gaps to improve quality measures</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Enhancing member and patient experiences</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Integrating solutions for greater care coordination</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Reducing the cost of care for members and patients</span></li>
</ul>
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">If you're interested in learning more about how health plans and health systems are partnering to leverage our 20+ years of virtual care innovation to meet the needs of members and patients, I'd be happy to schedule 15 minutes for us to connect.</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">Thank you,</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
&nbsp;</body>
